  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "OL_tMsqCdkKR"
   },
   "source": [
    "現在，下一步是建立一個函數來調整 dataset 的結構，以滿足 **DPOTrainer** 類別的要求。\n",
    "總之，函數將從 dataset 中取出一行，並僅提取三個必要的列。此外，它還對回應進行了較小的格式調整，透過在回應後添加標籤來使它們適應模型所需的格式。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 14,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "BhTHhLc5W1vK"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def chatml_format(example):\n",
    "    # get everything except the last message as input\n",
    "    prompt = tokenizer.apply_chat_template(example[\"chosen\"][:-1], tokenize=False,\n",
    "                                           add_generation_prompt=True)\n",
    "    # get the last assistant responses\n",
    "    chosen = example[\"chosen\"][-1][\"content\"] + \"<end_of_turn>\\n\"\n",
    "    rejected = example[\"rejected\"][-1][\"content\"] + \"<end_of_turn>\\n\"\n",
    "\n",
    "    return {\n",
    "        \"prompt\": prompt,\n",
    "        \"chosen\": chosen,\n",
    "        \"rejected\": rejected,\n",
    "    }"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "cpyHl0iMdz50"
   },
   "source": [
    "我將使用 dataset 的 **map** 函數將轉換應用到每一行並刪除原始列。"
   ]
