    "# Model to fine-tune\n",
    "model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(\n",
    "    model_name,\n",
    "    quantization_config=bnb_config,\n",
    "    attn_implementation='eager',\n",
    "    torch_dtype=torch.bfloat16\n",
    ")\n",
    "model.config.use_cache = False\n",
    "model.gradient_checkpointing_enable()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "rrOaJiZ3fRsu"
   },
   "source": [
    "下一步是設定訓練參數。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 20,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "rKPILNOLR-aK"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "#Name of the model you want to create.\n",
    "new_model = \"test_dpo_gemma_b\"\n",
    "\n",
    "# Training arguments\n",
    "#I'm using a batch_size of just 1 to avoid problems with memory consumption.\n",
    "training_args = TrainingArguments(\n",
    "    per_device_train_batch_size=1,\n",
    "    gradient_accumulation_steps=3,\n",
    "    gradient_checkpointing_kwargs={'use_reentrant':False},\n",
    "    gradient_checkpointing=True,\n",
    "    remove_unused_columns=False,\n",
    "    learning_rate=5.0e-06,\n",
    "    logging_strategy=\"epoch\",\n",
    "    lr_scheduler_type=\"cosine\",\n",
    "    num_train_epochs=10,\n",
    "    save_strategy=\"epoch\",\n",
    "    logging_steps=1,\n",
    "    output_dir=new_model,\n",
    "    optim=\"paged_adamw_32bit\",\n",
    "    warmup_steps=2,\n",
    "    bf16=True,\n",
    "    report_to=\"none\",\n",
    ")\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "0VWJ5uS-fYN5"
   },
   "source": [
    "我將解釋最重要和具體的訓練參數：\n",
    "**lr_scheduler_type**=\"cosine\"：學習率根據餘弦調度進行調整。它從 **learning_rate** 中指定的值開始，然後逐漸減少。\n",
    "**warmup_steps**=2：對於前兩個 epoch，學習率透過增加其值而不是減少來調整。目的是穩定學習過程。\n",
    "**Gradient_accumulation_steps**=3：節省記憶體。在更新模型權重之前，我會透過兩個步驟累積梯度。\n",
    "透過這些參數，我試圖找到一個記憶體需求較低的訓練設置，這要歸功於梯度累積、梯度checkpointing、小批量大小以及 bf16 和 paged_adamw_32bit 優化器的使用。\n",
    "現在您可以建立訓練器，並將兩個dataset、新建立的訓練參數、LoRA 設定和tokenizer 作為參數傳遞給它。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 21,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "nw8BR1_vC2rF"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "application/vnd.jupyter.widget-view+json": {
       "model_id": "470a9eb27fcc4932ba06ccd29d29e263",
       "version_major": 2,
